. do "D:\Hospital_Pharmacy program\code\dofile\01_hospital_all_regressions_v6.d
> o" 

. *============================================================================
> ===
. * 01_hospital_all_regressions_v6.do
. * Pharmacy is the main outcome: 500m, 1km, and 2km.
. * Pharmacy radius robustness uses 3km, 1-2km, and 2-3km.
. * Annual changes in pharmacy counts are additional outcomes at the main radii
> .
. * Nearest-public-hospital-assigned pharmacy counts avoid overlap across hospi
> tals.
. * Restaurant outcomes and restaurant placebo tests are excluded.
. * All count logs are ln(count), without adding 1.
. *============================================================================
> ===
